    "created_at": "2024-08-26T06:41:18Z",
    "updated_at": "2024-08-26T06:41:18Z",
    "body": "> The [seeking algorithm](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#dom-media-seek) already determines a _new playback position_ synchronously, but it is not observable to script synchronously. We could set the official playback position in this algorithm, and not set it in the `currentTime` setter.\r\n\r\nI have a different read to the spec that what you mention.\r\nIn the synchronous step of the seeking algorithm it's the \"**current playback position**\" that you set, not a \"new playback position\"",
    "author_association": "MEMBER",
    "pin": null,
